Yes, the inconsistencies also include removing duplicate values in an array and returning a single value as an object instead of an array. For example:

```
{ 
	"f": ["v"]
}
```

becomes

```
{
	"f": "v"
}
```

Or:

```
{
	"f": ["v1", "v1", "v2"]
}
```

becomes

```
{
	"f": ["v1", "v2"]
}
```
